  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Danish Embassy, Kampala - Going Carbon Neutral</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Carbon emissions from the Embassy&apos;s operations will be measured on an annual basis by the staff of the Uganda Carbon Bureau (UCB, the administrators of CAFEA) to determine the Embassy&apos;s carbon footprint from its different energy uses. Recommendations will be made annually on ways for the Embassy to reduce the size of its carbon emissions footprint. An equivalent number of carbon credits will then be purchased by the Embassy to offset its annual carbon footprint. Those credits will be purchased on the local voluntary market, where there are several already establish and accredited schemes involved in sequestration activities.</narrative>
  </description>
